{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773943251,"nonce":"eq5xDeHXhgu8LfieCBzQV63+4yU=","title":"Conversation DAG: branching display, fork/resume, path-aware hydration","message":"Add conversation branching support to Mandible: DAG-aware parsing, branch selector UI in History, fork/resume flows, and path-aware hydration.\n\n## Scope\n\n### P1: DB + Parser (dag_uuid, dag_parent_uuid)\n- DB migration: add dag_uuid TEXT and dag_parent_uuid TEXT columns to conversation_blocks\n- Index on (conversation_id, dag_parent_uuid) for backward-walk queries\n- ClaudeParser: propagate JSONL uuid/parentUuid as dag_uuid/dag_parent_uuid on emitted blocks\n- ParseResult: add branch_points metadata\n\n### P2: API — path resolution + fork endpoints\n- GET /api/conversations/:id?leaf=\u003cdag_uuid\u003e — walk dag_parent_uuid backward from leaf, return ordered blocks for that path. Falls back to current behavior when leaf omitted.\n- GET /api/conversations/:id/forks — return fork points with branch summaries (first text, turn count, duration per branch)\n- POST /api/conversations/:id/fork — call SDK forkSession(id, { upToMessageId }), trigger ingestion, return new conversation\n- POST /api/conversations/:id/resume — create Console session with resume params (provider_session_id + resume_at_message)\n\n### P3: Branch selector UI + message action bar\n- BranchSelector component: horizontal separator bar between user msg and divergent assistant response\n  - Monospace 11px, opacity 0.35→0.5→1.0 (rest→visible→hover)\n  - Zero height when M=1 (no branches)\n  - \"Branch N of M ◂ ▸\" with arrow navigation\n  - Click label to expand branch overview strip (compact cards: first ~40 chars, turn count, duration)\n  - Currently-live branch gets pulsing dot indicator\n- Unified message action bar: hover-revealed container per message\n  - Contains: branch selector (when applicable), copy, select, resume-from-here, fork-from-here\n  - Absolutely positioned, no layout shift on hover\n  - Works in both History transcript view and Console stream view\n\n### P4: Fork/resume flows + settings\n- \"Resume from here\" action: creates Console session with provider_session_id + resume_at_message, navigates to Console tab\n- \"Fork from here\" action: calls fork API, registers new conversation, navigates to it\n- Auto-fork policy setting: auto_fork (default) | prompt | allow_concurrent\n- Resume conflict detection: check if conversation is active in Console before resuming\n- SDKBackend: thread resume_at_message through to sdk.query() options (resume + resumeSessionAt)\n\n### P5: Hydration DAG-awareness\n- TerminalPane hydration: pass leaf param (from session resume_at_message) when fetching conversation\n- getConversation API call gains optional leaf parameter\n- No changes needed to conversationBlocksToStreamEvents, computeLiveTail, flushPendingSSE\n\n## Design decisions\n- Fork always means \"extract linear path from root to message X\" — no \"fork all branches\"\n- Branch selector placement: between user message and divergent assistant response (semantically correct)\n- Server-side path resolution (not client-side DAG navigation) — minimal pipeline changes\n- Auto-fork default when resuming active conversation — zero corruption risk","files":null}]}